      "description": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"dd370f27cf921179\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nHaematoxylin and eosin-stained ... of gemistocytes and astrocytes with dark staining pleomorphic nuclei. <strong>Stroma shows hyalinized blood vessels, microcystic degeneration and foci of calcification</strong>. Gliomas account for 40–50% of all intracranial tumours....\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"dd370f27cf921179\">>>",
